rocess several sequences of images and output the measurements of each.</sp=
an>&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://cellprofiler-examples.s3.amazonaws.com/ExampleT=
rackObjects.zip" title=3D"">Download</a>&nbsp;(10 MB)
